# figtab-repo

ResearchWorld position: `figtab-repo`, holding **presentation** (the delivered
figures and tables) for the Mauna Loa CO2 objective (issue #1).

- Delivered path (work assignment): `report/figures/` — the report's single
  figure (annual mean CO2 1960–2025 with the OLS linear and quadratic fits),
  its generator and the input contract. See `report/figures/README.md`.
- `work/` — generation-side material, not part of the delivery: verified
  working copies of the canonical data, and the synthetic layout-draft
  harness (`draft_fits.json`, `inspect_render.py`).
- The data and fits come from `experiment-repo` (`data/`, analysis handoff);
  the report text and embedding are `paper-repo`'s (`report/report.md`).
